# 统一行尾：仓库与所有平台检出都用 LF
# （不加这条，Windows 上 git 会把 LF 转 CRLF，导致「整个文件被改动」的假 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary

# 锁文件在 merge 时容易冲突，且不需要人工看 diff
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
web/package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated

# 让 GitHub 语言统计别把 .vue 之外的东西算进来
*.md linguist-documentation
